# HHT blog discovery

Before any HotelHotTubs opportunity discovery, read and follow `.agents/skills/hht-blog-discovery/SKILL.md`. The seed list is `.agents/skills/hht-blog-discovery/blog_discovery_seed_queries.csv`.

- Run priority 1 queries before priority 2. Top 100 US organic results per query, via the Semrush MCP connector, in batches of about 15.
- Dedupe by registrable domain. Never re-triage a domain already in the CRM, leads table, or skipped list.
- `guest_post` goes through guest-post feasibility. `link_insertion` is stored as a ranking-page lead, not a guest-post target.
- Email kai@useterrace.ai when a batch finishes.
- Stop after the first priority-1 batch and wait for an explicit go-ahead. Do not fall back to the 100-result frontier.
